# NyxOS LIVE MEDIUM ONLY. Kodachi's live-session trust model: the live user
# is root-equivalent without a prompt, matching what the dashboard's polkit
# rule (90-nyx-dashboard.rules) already assumes of wheel. The installer's
# post-install step deliberately does NOT copy this file — an installed
# NyxOS keeps archinstall's password-prompting wheel rule.
%wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
